1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Jizzakh, Uzbekistan: 342 mm of rain a year,
and almost none in summer.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
AralSentinel turns ten years of NASA POWER
and MODIS data into a field risk index.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
It ranks three-year crop rotations
by FAO rules and by the farmer's priorities.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
A 20% water cut costs this rotation 20% of its yield,
about $214 per hectare (estimate).

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
It warns about the alfalfa trap,
in English, Uzbek and Russian.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Free, open and works offline.
Try it at symphonious-twilight-34e8d7.netlify.app
